abstract: >-
  Pair-max rainfall-motion and residual indicators, fixed15/no-advection,
  finite-fill, scaling-recovery, local-support, donor-support, reconstruction-scale
  and complete-archive window-integrity controls, with unrestricted
  synthetic software tests. The historical fixed15 interface is retained.
